<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">2pe</book>
  <para style="h">Piyɛri Filana Suran</para>
  <para style="toc1">Piyɛri Filana</para>
  <para style="toc2">2PI</para>
  <para style="mt1">Piyɛri la Kitabu Filana</para>
  <para style="mt2">Piyɛri Alla la Kuma Kitabu Filana</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin sɛbɛni lemɛniya mɔɔilu le ma. A sɛbɛ kun kɛni mɔɔilu le kɛlɛ ko ri mɛnilu ye dina ko karan kɛla mɛn kɛni tɛ Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma kelen di. Wo wuya karanmɔɔilu tɛrɛ ra basan lemɛniya mɔɔilu la Piyɛri la waati rɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wuya dinailu lase mɔɔilu tɛ ban dunuɲa rɔ muumɛ. Wo rɔ, kawandili mɛn sɛbɛni Piyɛri la Kitabu filana kɔndɔ, wo koilu ri kɛ ikɔ tuun bi. A ye lemɛniya mɔɔilu kawandila ko ii ye fanka don Maari la ko lɔn dɔ, kosa ii kana ii jɛrɛ majuuwaya wuya karanmɔɔilu la fili kuma fuuilu fɛ.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Nde Simeyɔn Piyɛri Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na baaraden ni a la talibidenba, nde le ka ɲin sɛbɛ, ka a lawa ai ma, ai le mɛnilu fanan da lemɛniya sɔrɔn mɛn ni an na gbiliya ka kan ai ka mɛn sɔrɔn an na Alla ni an na kisila la telenbaya fɛ, Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin. <verse eid="2PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Alla ye hinani ni jususuma di ai ma, ka wara Alla la kolɔn ni an Maari Isa la kolɔn dɔ.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lemɛniya mɔɔilu joo bɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Alla la fanka ra fɛrɛ bɛɛ di an ma kosa an ye an na dunuɲaratɛɛ ni an na Alla ɲɛsilanɲɛ kɛ Alla lɔn dɔ mɛn ka an kili a la gbiliya ni a la ɲumaya rɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Wo rɔ, a ra an lahidi lahidi gbɛlɛn na, mɛnilu ka bon ka tamin bɛɛ la, kosa ai ye ai jɛrɛ laban kɔsɔ koilu ma kunfan ye mɔɔilu lɔla mɛn ma dunuɲa ɲin dɔ, ko ai fanan di Alla la kɛɲa sɔrɔn. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Wo rɔ, ai ye karan ai fanka bɛɛ la, ka sɔnɲuma la ai la lemɛniya kan, ka lɔnnin la sɔnɲuma kan, <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />ka jɛrɛ mira la lɔnnin kan, ka tunadiya la jɛrɛ mira kan, ka Alla lɔn la tunadiya kan, <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />ka badenmaya ladiyaɲɛ la Alla lɔn kan, ka kaninteya la badenmaya ladiyaɲɛ kan. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Ni kɛɲa ɲinilu wa to ai rɔ, ka sabati, ii tɛ ai to tunnagboya ni baarabaliya rɔ an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin lɔn dɔ fewu. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Kɔni ni woilu tɛ mɔɔ mɛn dɔ, wo tii ɲa tɛ ko ragbɛla, a totɔ le ikomin ɲa funyen, ka ɲina ko Alla ra a julumun kɔrɔilu kafari.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Wo le rɔ, badenmailu, ai ye ai raja ka tamin sisɛn na Alla la kilili lamɛnna diya a ni ai suwandinin ko, ka a masɔrɔn ni ai ka wo kɛ, ai ti be muumɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Wo rɔ, an Maari ni an Nakisila Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin di habadan mansaya ladon fɛrɛ ba di ai ma.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Wo le ka a kɛ, n ye ko ɲinilu labilala ai la waati bɛɛ, hali ai ka ii lɔn, ka wo tuɲa ko mira fanan gben ai ka mɛn sɔrɔn. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />N na miriya rɔ, fanin n ye n nii la faribanku rɔ, n ka kan n ye wo koilu labila ai la kosa ii ye to ai ɲana. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Ka a masɔrɔn n ka a lɔn, n nii bɔtɔla le ten faribanku rɔ, ikomin an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin jɛrɛ ka n nalɔnni ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Wo rɔ, n ye karanna le fɛrɛ bɛɛ rɔ, hali n na saya kɔrɔ, ko ɲinilu ye se labilala ai la waati bɛɛ.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri tɛrɛ ra Isa la gbiliya yen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Nba, Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko rɔ a ni a la fanka, an ma mɔɔilu la tali rabɛniilu fɔ ai yɛ ka bɛn wo koilu ma, baa andeilu jɛrɛ le ka a la gbiliya yen an ɲailu la. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />A ka kunnafulen ni gbiliya sɔrɔn an Fa Alla le bolo, a ka wo kan namɛn ka fara Gbiliya Kunnafulen ba la tuma mɛn na ko, «N Dencɛ le ɲin di, n ye mɛn kaninna, a ra n hɛnɛ kosɛbɛ!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.17</char> A ragbɛ Matiyu suran 17 kuma diya 1 haan 5 ni Marika suran 9 kuma diya 2 haan 7 ni Luka suran 9 kuma diya 28 haan 35 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />An jɛrɛ ka wo kumakan mɛn, ka bɔ sankolo rɔ, an tɛrɛ ye a tɔrɔfɛ koyinkɛ sɛniman kan waati mɛn na.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Ikɔ tuun, kelalaselailu la kuma gbɛnin an ma ten ka tamin fɔlɔ la. Ai ka kan ka ai hankili lɔ woilu la ikomin fitinna mɛn ye mɛlɛnna dibi rɔ haan bandaka, bandaka da lolo fanan ye mɛlɛn damira ai jusu rɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Mɛn taminni a bɛɛ la, ai ka wo lɔn, ko Kitabu nabiya kuma si ma fara keladen fisamante la ko ɲafɔ ɲa ma. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Ka a masɔrɔn nabiya kuma si tɛrɛ tɛ bɔla adamadenilu sawo rɔ, kɔni Alla la Nii Sɛniman de tɛrɛ ye adamadenilu dɛmɛnna, ka kuma ka fara Alla la.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Wuya karanmɔɔilu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Kɔni wuya kelalaselailu tɛrɛ ye jama tɛma waati taminin. Wuya karanmɔɔilu fanan di yen ai tɛma. Ii ri wuya karanilu ladon ai tɛma gbundu rɔ mɛnilu ri mɔɔilu halaki haan ka ii ban ii Tii rɔ mɛn da ii kunka. Woilu ye halaki le kilila ii jɛrɛ ma jonna! <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Mɔɔ siyaman di bila ii la ko haramuninniilu kɔfɛ, ka tuɲa sila lafɛya. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Karanmɔɔ ɲinilu ri ai labaara majuuwaya rɔ ii la kuma rabɛniilu fɛ ii la wasabaliya rɔ. Kɔni ii kiti ko ra damira bi tɛ wo ri, ii halaki ko tɛ mɛnna butun.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Mɛlɛka mɛnilu ka julumun kɛ waati taminin dɔ, Alla tɛ woilu latankala, kɔni a ka ii lafili jahanama rɔ, ka ii bila jɔlɔkɔ la dibi rɔ ii kiti lon ɲɛrɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Mɔɔ fɔlɔilu dunuɲa rɔ, a ma woilu fanan natanka, a ka ji bɔni ba lana Alla lɔnbaliilu ma, kɔni a ka mɔɔ wɔrɔnwula le dɔrɔn nakisi a ni Nuhan mɛn tɛrɛ ye telenbaya la ko kawandili bɔla.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.5</char> A ragbɛ A Damira suran 6 kuma diya 1 haan suran 7 kuma diya 24 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Alla ka Sɔdɔmu ni Kɔmɔri soilu fanan halaki le ta la, ka ii kɛ buuri ri. A ka ii kɛ misali ri Alla lafililailu yɛ, ko mɛn natɔ kɛ diya ii yɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.6</char> A ragbɛ A Damira suran 19 kuma diya 24 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Alla ka Luti mɔɔ telenni fanan kunka le, mɛn jusu tɔrɔra wo sariyalɔnbaliilu ko haramuninilu la ko rɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Baa wo mɔɔ telenni tɛrɛ siini ii tɛma, a sɔnɔmɛ telenni tora tɔrɔla lon lon ii la kojuuilu la ko rɔ, a tɛrɛ ye mɛnilu yenna, ka ii lamɛn. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Wo koilu le bɛɛ ye a yirakala ko Maari ka a lɔn a ri mɔɔ kunka tɔrɔya rɔ ɲa mɛn ma mɛn telennin, ka telenbaliilu mara ɲakankatan ɲɛrɔ kiti la lon kɔrɔ, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />katarabi wo mɔɔilu ma, mɛnilu bilanin ko kɔsɔniilu kɔfɛ, ii faribanku diyanan koilu, ka murunti fanka bɛɛ kɔrɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Wuya karanmɔɔ ɲinilu wakalinin, ii wasonin. Ii tɛ silanna gbiliya tiilu lafɛya la. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Hali mɛlɛka mɛnilu fanka ni sɛɛbɛ ka bon wuya karanmɔɔ ɲinilu ri, woilu tɛ wo suilu lafɛyala kiti rɔ Maari ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Kɔni mɔɔ ɲinilu ye koilu lafɛyala ii ma mɛnilu lɔn, ka kɛ ikomin sobo hankilidɔɔ mira ta mɛnilu ye halakila. Wo mɔɔilu halakila ikomin soboilu, <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />ii la telenbaliya bɛɛ ri sara ii la. A duman ii yɛ, ii ye wasa ii diyanan ko kɔrɔnilu bɛɛ la tele rɔ. Ii wa kɛ dɔɔnnin kɛla ai tɔrɔfɛ, maloya ni kunnajii le a ri, ka sɛwa ii diyanan koilu la. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Ii ye kaninkɛ ɲininna ii ɲa la. Ii tɛ wasala julumun dɔ muumɛ! Ii ye fankatanilu masɔmɔnna. Ii jusu dorinnin wasabalidaya koilu le la. Dankadenilu le ii ri. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Ii ra sila telenni bila, ka bila Beyɔri dencɛ Balami la sila kɔfɛ fili rɔ mɛn kaninna telenbaliya sara la. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Kɔni a ka mafɔli sɔrɔn a la ko masɔsɔ rɔ. A la fali mɛn ti se kumala, wo ka a mɔɔ kan nabɔ le, ka keladen fisamante lasa a la hankilidɔɔya rɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.16</char> A ragbɛ Jateilu suran 31 kuma diya 16 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Wuya karanmɔɔ ɲinilu kɛni le ikomin tenke denka janin, ikomin fɔɲɔ ba ye duru mɛn tuntunna san ma, dibi ba le lamarani ii ɲɛrɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Ii ye waso kuma fuuilu fɔla, ka mɔɔilu lakunfan faribanku diyanan ko haramunninilu la, mɛnilu gbansan ye ii sɔrɔnna mɔɔ filiniilu la. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Ii ye mɔɔilu lahidila hɔrɔya la, adon, ii le jɛrɛ ye kɔsɔ koilu jɔnya rɔ. Ka a masɔrɔn foyi wa se mɔɔ la, a ri kɛ wo jɔn di. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Ni ii ra matanka dunuɲa kɔsɔ koilu ma an Maari ni an Nakisila Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin lɔn ko rɔ, ka ii sɔn fanan wo koilu ye se ii la, ii la ban tun di juuya ka tamin ii la fɔlɔ la. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Baa a tun ka fisa wo tiilu kana telenbaya sila lɔn, sani ii ye a lɔn ka ii kɔnkɔ don jamari sɛniman na ii ka mɛn sɔrɔn. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Mɛn kɛni ii la, wo ra sanda ɲinilu tuɲa yiraka ko, «Wulu ye a kɔsɛla a baji ma le,»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.22</char> Sandailu suran 26 kuma diya 11</note> a ni «I wa kɔsɛ mako dɔrɔn, a ri wa a makurukuru bɔɔ rɔ.»<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Maari na lon ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />N kaninteilu, n na bataki filana le ɲin di, n da mɛn sɛbɛ ai ma. N ka ii fila sɛbɛ ai ma le kosa n ye koilu labila ai la, ka hankili sɛniman lasu, <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />kosa, keladen fisamante sɛnimanilu tɛrɛ ra kuma mɛnilu fɔ, woilu ye labila ai la a ni an Maari ni an Nakisila la jamariliilu, talibidenbailu ka mɛnilu lase ai ma. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Ai ye a lɔn fɔlɔ ko lon labanilu rɔ, mayɛlɛlilailu ri na ai mayɛlɛ diya mɛnilu ye bilala ii la kunfan kojuuilu kɔfɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Ii ri a fɔ ko, «Isa ka ai lahidi a na ko mɛn na, wo ye min? Kɛbi an benbailu faara waati mɛn na koilu bɛɛ ye ɲa kelen ma ka bɔ dunuɲa dan waati ma haan bi.» <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Ka a masɔrɔn, ii ye a lawulila a ma le ka ɲina ɲin na ko, waati taminin siyaman Alla ka sankolo dan a kumakan na, ka duu ni ji bɔ a ɲɔɔnna ka to ji tɛma. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Wo ji le ka wo waati dunuɲa bɛɛ halaki ji bɔni ba la.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.6</char> A ragbɛ A Damira suran 1 kuma diya 6 haan 9 ni suran 7 kuma diya 11 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Kɔni bi sankolo ni duukolo lamarani ta le kanma wo kuma kelen de fɛ, kiti la lon ni Alla lɔnbaliilu halaki kɔrɔ.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Kɔni, n kaninteilu, ai kana ɲina ko kelen ɲin na, tele kelen kɛnin de Maari ɲakɔrɔ ikomin san waa kelen (1,000), san waa kelen (1,000) fanan ikomin tele kelen. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Maari tɛ mɛnna a la lahidi kanbali diya, ikomin mɔɔ doilu ye a mirila mɛnna ɲa mɛn ma. Kɔni a diɲani ai yɛ le ka a masɔrɔn a tɛ a fɛ mɔɔ si ye halaki, kɔni fɔɔ mɔɔilu bɛɛ ye ii kɔnkɔ don ii hakɛilu la.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Adon, Maari na lon ye sela le, a ri mɔɔilu latɛrɛn ikomin son. Wo lon, sankolo ri tamin halaki kan ba rɔ, a rakɛfenilu fanan di janin. Duukolo ni a rakɛfenilu bɛɛ ri lɛnkɛnɛmaya. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Baa woilu bɛɛ ye halakila le wo ɲa ma, ai ka kan ai ye kɛ mɔɔ su ɲumanilu ri? Ai la dunuɲaratɛɛ ye sɛninya Alla lɔn dɔ, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />ai wa Alla na lon makɔnɔ, ai kɛwaliilu ye a la na lakaliya, sankolo ni a rakɛfenilu ri halaki ta la lon mɛn na. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Adon, Alla ra a lahidi sankolo kura ni duukolo kura la, telenbaya ye tola yɔrɔ mɛn. An ye wo le makɔnɔla.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.13</char> A ragbɛ Esayi suran 65 kuma diya 17 ni suran 66 kuma diya 22 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Wo le rɔ, n kaninteilu, baa ai ye wo ko makɔnɔla, ai ye fɛrɛ bɛɛ kɛ kosa a ye ai tɛrɛn kojuu ni sɔnjuu tɛ si ai la, jususuma ye to ai ni Alla tɛma. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Ai ye a lala ko an Maari la diɲɛ le mɔɔilu lakisila ikomin an diyanan badenma Pɔli ka a sɛbɛ ai ma ɲa mɛn ma walijiya rɔ Alla ka mɛn di a ma. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />A ka wo le sɛbɛ a la bataki bɛɛ kɔndɔ ka bɛn ko ɲinilu ma. A la bataki yɔrɔ doilu ɲayen ma di, hankilidɔɔilu ni karanbaliilu ri woilu kɔrɔilu ɲakɛ, ikomin ii ka Kitabu dogbɛrɛilu fanan kɛ ɲa mɛn ma, ka ii jɛrɛ halaki.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Wo le rɔ, n kaninteilu, baa ai le lalɔnnin, ai ye a kɛ ai hankili la, kosa sariyalɔnbaliilu la fili kana se ai ma, ka bɔnɔ ai lɔdiya barakani rɔ. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Kɔni ai ye to bonyala an Maari ni an Nakisila Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na sɔli ni a la lɔnnin dɔ. Gbiliya ye di ale le ma sisɛn haan habadan. Amina.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>